uestion/worked-solution "First, to get the minor of ${d}_{51}$, we remove the $5$th row and $1$st column: \n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & -8 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ ∗ & 5 & 0 & 7 & 1 \\\\ ∗ & 0 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ ∗ & 0 & 6 & 8 & 3 \\\\ 11 & ∗ & ∗ & ∗ & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{51}=|\\begin{aligned}-8 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 7 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 6 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nNow, the cofactor of ${d}_{51}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{51} & =(-1)^{5+1}{M}_{51} \\\\  & ={M}_{51} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-8 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 7 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 6 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186309271 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "58148550-e41f-5df0-80dc-e783619cf87d" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Cofactor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d121efe-a33f-5699-a3e3-cd3ec4a36782" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309273} {:answer/id #uuid "1b6eab7a-1fe0-58dc-85b7-8a7c4dbbb40c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}1 & -8 & 2 & -5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 6 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -1 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 3 & 8\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309274} {:answer/id #uuid "0007e7ad-808e-5128-98f4-009625a08aa8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}1 & -8 & 2 & -5 \\\\ -1 & -1 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 3 & 8 \\\\ -9 & 3 & 7 & -9\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309275} {:answer/id #uuid "207afcce-2b99-5b0f-a0e3-16d11bff390e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-|\\begin{aligned}1 & -8 & 2 & -5 \\\\ -1 & -1 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 3 & 8 \\\\ -9 & 3 & 7 & -9\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309276} {:answer/id #uuid "1c48f884-9a2e-5b38-8e98-927b8774adea" :answer/ty